1800
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,046
Over mountains and through valleys

5407
00:00:05,407 --> 00:00:08,613
A ninja's body is like an airplane, flying freely through the sky

8865
00:00:08,865 --> 00:00:12,298
Honest and kind, Hattori is loved by all

12452
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:15,632
With eyes opened wide and lips held tight

15965
00:00:15,965 --> 00:00:19,366
Face covered with a mask, cheeks all puffed up

19532
00:00:19,532 --> 00:00:22,690
Catching villains with agile moves as fast as lightning

22990
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,457
Catching bad guys with bizarre tricks, just like magic

26810
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:29,836
Speaking like poetry, polite and spirited

31750
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:34,666
"Mysterious Flying Object"

41586
00:00:41,586 --> 00:00:42,670
Is it over there?

43139
00:00:43,139 --> 00:00:44,636
It's too far

46938
00:00:46,938 --> 00:00:50,294
Without a telephoto lens, it's impossible to get a shot

50345
00:00:50,345 --> 00:00:52,087
What should I do? I promised Yumeko

52128
00:00:52,128 --> 00:00:54,574
that I'd take photos of birds for her

56393
00:00:56,393 --> 00:00:59,117
Photography really isn't that simple after all

67209
00:01:07,209 --> 00:01:09,070
Please god, let me complete this task

69120
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,869
and have photos to give to Yumeko

71962
00:01:11,962 --> 00:01:14,950
I wanted to take some nice photos for the bulletin board

75258
00:01:15,258 --> 00:01:17,065
Whoa, what's going on?

79537
00:01:19,537 --> 00:01:21,391
Oh my gosh, it's a flying saucer!

82056
00:01:22,056 --> 00:01:23,192
Awesome!

89376
00:01:29,376 --> 00:01:31,570
"Yesterday afternoon, while I was at the shrine"

91611
00:01:31,611 --> 00:01:33,330
"I originally planned to photograph birds"

93402
00:01:33,402 --> 00:01:34,380
"When all of a sudden..."

94420
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:36,708
"a flying saucer appeared in the western sky"

96758
00:01:36,758 --> 00:01:38,656
"It was a mysterious object of unknown origin"

98707
00:01:38,707 --> 00:01:41,115
"So I immediately snapped a photo"

101156
00:01:41,156 --> 00:01:42,843
"Its shape was like this"

103016
00:01:43,016 --> 00:01:45,036
Kenichi, you're amazing!

105256
00:01:45,256 --> 00:01:47,463
My photography skills are pretty good, huh?

108009
00:01:48,009 --> 00:01:49,892
He still has no idea

109997
00:01:49,997 --> 00:01:51,617
It really is hard to believe!

112929
00:01:52,929 --> 00:01:54,790
It truly is a rare sight

115377
00:01:55,377 --> 00:01:56,260
That's right

116300
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:57,961
Ah, it really is a flying saucer!

118011
00:01:58,011 --> 00:02:00,097
It's my first time seeing a flying saucer too

120549
00:02:00,549 --> 00:02:02,588
If we could shake hands with an alien

122629
00:02:02,629 --> 00:02:05,081
we'd become famous overnight and make the news!

125122
00:02:05,122 --> 00:02:06,321
I've got to see it for myself tonight!

126362
00:02:06,362 --> 00:02:07,656
Yeah, I want to go too!

127707
00:02:07,707 --> 00:02:08,713
Great, I'm going too!

128763
00:02:08,763 --> 00:02:10,963
I want to take more photos of flying saucers!

131060
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:12,371
A real photo of a flying saucer...

132411
00:02:12,411 --> 00:02:14,844
How could it be that easy to photograph? So clueless

138006
00:02:18,006 --> 00:02:20,532
What's an unidentified flying object?

140652
00:02:20,652 --> 00:02:22,996
It's a flying object like a flying saucer

143037
00:02:23,037 --> 00:02:25,755
It flew here from somewhere in outer space

145796
00:02:25,796 --> 00:02:28,748
So it's like riding a shooting star to Earth?

150392
00:02:30,392 --> 00:02:32,301
That's just a fairy tale

152342
00:02:32,342 --> 00:02:33,691
Why is it called a flying saucer?

153732
00:02:33,732 --> 00:02:36,428
Because when it flies, it looks like a saucer

156561
00:02:36,561 --> 00:02:39,134
Oh, so it's this kind of flying saucer

160819
00:02:40,819 --> 00:02:43,026
It's a Koga concealed weapon!

163359
00:02:43,359 --> 00:02:45,288
Alright, all packed and ready!

165574
00:02:45,574 --> 00:02:47,532
Hey, Hattori-kun, come with us!

167573
00:02:47,573 --> 00:02:49,866
I cannot. I have important business to finish

169907
00:02:49,907 --> 00:02:51,452
I will accompany you next time

171546
00:02:51,546 --> 00:02:53,044
Oh, really? Okay then

173085
00:02:53,085 --> 00:02:54,265
If I get some good photos

174306
00:02:54,306 --> 00:02:55,958
I'll definitely bring them back to show you

176035
00:02:56,035 --> 00:02:57,185
I'm off!

179224
00:02:59,224 --> 00:03:01,902
Oh dear, why are they so happy?

183097
00:03:03,097 --> 00:03:04,763
A picnic, yay!

185040
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:07,189
- Picnic...
- So fun!

188952
00:03:08,952 --> 00:03:10,062
Yan...

190942
00:03:10,942 --> 00:03:12,795
Ah, time to eat...

192836
00:03:12,836 --> 00:03:14,708
Yay, awesome!

195632
00:03:15,632 --> 00:03:18,664
Kenichi, is this the direction where you saw the UFO?

198751
00:03:18,751 --> 00:03:19,672
Yeah

199787
00:03:19,787 --> 00:03:21,011
Let me see

201752
00:03:21,752 --> 00:03:24,604
That's right, this atmosphere is perfect for a UFO to appear

204655
00:03:24,655 --> 00:03:26,391
Yay, let me eat first!

206432
00:03:26,432 --> 00:03:27,433
Let me eat first, okay?

207605
00:03:27,605 --> 00:03:28,951
You go ahead and eat

209731
00:03:29,731 --> 00:03:31,558
Wow, I see it!

213446
00:03:33,446 --> 00:03:35,545
Yumeko, what did you wish for?

215596
00:03:35,596 --> 00:03:38,239
I wished for the angels to let me see a UFO

218280
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,864
I think it'll be pretty hard to see a UFO

219905
00:03:39,905 --> 00:03:41,593
- Because Kenichi was just imagining it
- No way

221634
00:03:41,634 --> 00:03:43,184
It wasn't my imagination, I saw it with my own eyes!

223231
00:03:43,231 --> 00:03:44,426
And I took a photo of it with my camera

224467
00:03:44,467 --> 00:03:46,522
I don't think there are any, I'm leaving

227082
00:03:47,082 --> 00:03:47,994
Kemumaki

228035
00:03:48,035 --> 00:03:50,271
What if we really do see one?

230340
00:03:50,340 --> 00:03:51,596
I know that's impossible

231636
00:03:51,636 --> 00:03:53,726
Besides, I have something important to do

233777
00:03:53,777 --> 00:03:54,873
That's right, Yumeko

234924
00:03:54,924 --> 00:03:56,839
Let's just ignore Kemumaki

256725
00:04:16,725 --> 00:04:19,331
All right, let me play the UFO

261932
00:04:21,932 --> 00:04:23,046
It appeared!

263319
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,699
Yeah, it appeared!

268869
00:04:28,869 --> 00:04:30,369
Who is it? Who's messing with me?

270410
00:04:30,410 --> 00:04:32,803
Just as I expected, you're the one behind this!

272844
00:04:32,844 --> 00:04:35,478
Damn it, I was just about to pull it off!

275556
00:04:35,556 --> 00:04:38,659
You just wanted to humiliate Kenichi, how despicable!

278981
00:04:38,981 --> 00:04:42,440
This time we're definitely having a duel, Hattori-kun!

290553
00:04:50,553 --> 00:04:52,497
Wow, it appeared!

292703
00:04:52,703 --> 00:04:53,929
That's amazing!

293986
00:04:53,986 --> 00:04:55,590
Kenichi, hurry up and take a picture!

295758
00:04:55,758 --> 00:04:57,425
Yeah, taking it...

298732
00:04:58,732 --> 00:05:00,286
That's amazing!

300332
00:05:00,332 --> 00:05:02,673
Wow, that's amazing!

314885
00:05:14,885 --> 00:05:17,371
Oh no, I just ran out of shuriken!

318988
00:05:18,988 --> 00:05:19,928
Hattori-kun

319978
00:05:19,978 --> 00:05:22,308
I'll settle this with you another day, see ya!

325328
00:05:25,328 --> 00:05:26,350
Ah, awesome!

326391
00:05:26,391 --> 00:05:28,719
I took a lot of precious photos just now

328770
00:05:28,770 --> 00:05:29,886
That's great

329937
00:05:29,937 --> 00:05:30,737
That's right

330787
00:05:30,787 --> 00:05:33,272
There must be a UFO base in this town

333519
00:05:33,519 --> 00:05:35,780
This is great, I'm so excited!

341280
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:43,503
Wow, these photos are amazing!

343553
00:05:43,553 --> 00:05:44,837
Right, Kenichi?

345670
00:05:45,670 --> 00:05:46,960
Hattori-kun

347164
00:05:47,164 --> 00:05:50,246
Look, the photos from last night have all been developed!

350293
00:05:50,293 --> 00:05:52,639
It would've been great if you were there too

352700
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:55,978
Kenichi, those flying objects you saw...

356028
00:05:56,028 --> 00:05:57,645
Were they something like this?

360059
00:06:00,059 --> 00:06:01,539
Based on what you're saying...

364993
00:06:04,993 --> 00:06:05,987
Hattori-kun

366037
00:06:06,037 --> 00:06:07,519
I still don't understand why

367570
00:06:07,570 --> 00:06:09,707
Well, you see, every night I go to that spot

369758
00:06:09,758 --> 00:06:11,570
to practice throwing shurikens and keep in shape

371620
00:06:11,620 --> 00:06:13,554
I never expected you all to make such a fuss

373595
00:06:13,595 --> 00:06:16,270
and go there looking for UFOs, I'm truly sorry

377103
00:06:17,103 --> 00:06:18,300
Oh no, Hattori-kun

378341
00:06:18,341 --> 00:06:21,261
How am I supposed to explain this to them now?

381312
00:06:21,312 --> 00:06:23,279
Oh dear, what should I do?

383330
00:06:23,330 --> 00:06:25,969
Honestly, I don't know what to do either

388590
00:06:28,590 --> 00:06:31,456
"Ninja Art: Body Freeze Technique"

404931
00:06:44,931 --> 00:06:46,423
Let me help you eat that

410943
00:06:50,943 --> 00:06:52,666
Hey, why did you eat my food?

412716
00:06:52,716 --> 00:06:53,869
That's so mean!

414081
00:06:54,081 --> 00:06:55,503
Kenichi, it's just a bun

415543
00:06:55,543 --> 00:06:56,985
Why get so worked up over it?

417026
00:06:57,026 --> 00:06:59,160
Hey... what do you want now?

419459
00:06:59,459 --> 00:07:00,742
You want to fight, is that it?

420792
00:07:00,792 --> 00:07:02,960
Sounds great, bring it on!

423325
00:07:03,325 --> 00:07:04,974
Even though Hattori-kun isn't by my side

425014
00:07:05,014 --> 00:07:06,788
I can still take you on!

431671
00:07:11,671 --> 00:07:13,200
Yan...

439174
00:07:19,174 --> 00:07:20,194
Yan...

440261
00:07:20,261 --> 00:07:21,928
Yan...

444823
00:07:24,823 --> 00:07:27,450
That hurts so much...

453489
00:07:33,489 --> 00:07:34,550
Nice moves!

454601
00:07:34,601 --> 00:07:35,471
Wow, Hattori-kun!

455521
00:07:35,521 --> 00:07:37,306
That technique you just used was amazing!

457347
00:07:37,347 --> 00:07:39,490
Indeed, that's called the Body Freeze Technique

459530
00:07:39,530 --> 00:07:40,770
It's like striking pressure points

462002
00:07:42,002 --> 00:07:42,808
Hattori-kun

462869
00:07:42,869 --> 00:07:45,277
Is there any way I can learn that technique?

465370
00:07:45,370 --> 00:07:47,465
Where there's a will, there's a way

467506
00:07:47,506 --> 00:07:48,420
It's very easy to learn

468553
00:07:48,553 --> 00:07:49,720
Please teach me!

469761
00:07:49,761 --> 00:07:52,623
Please teach me this skill, it's really useful!

478371
00:07:58,371 --> 00:08:00,037
I'll give it a try first

481105
00:08:01,105 --> 00:08:02,760
Yan...

487548
00:08:07,548 --> 00:08:08,967
Doing that is wrong

489017
00:08:09,017 --> 00:08:11,964
You shouldn't use ninjutsu to do bad things, right?

492060
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:13,100
I'm sorry

493197
00:08:13,197 --> 00:08:14,686
I'll use it to do good deeds!

494727
00:08:14,727 --> 00:08:16,735
Please teach me the Body Freeze Technique

497353
00:08:17,353 --> 00:08:20,055
Even if I teach you, you won't learn it overnight

500106
00:08:20,106 --> 00:08:21,591
I'll put my heart into learning it!

501780
00:08:21,780 --> 00:08:23,513
All right, I'll teach you, Yan

504432
00:08:24,432 --> 00:08:25,620
Now, first...

505660
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:27,070
you focus your mind

507120
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,103
and then enter a state of selflessness

511965
00:08:31,965 --> 00:08:33,650
Yan...

518808
00:08:38,808 --> 00:08:41,253
Using this technique on falling leaves is rather difficult

521303
00:08:41,303 --> 00:08:43,290
It's much easier on living things

523350
00:08:43,350 --> 00:08:44,350
Understand?

524626
00:08:44,626 --> 00:08:45,599
Really?

525650
00:08:45,650 --> 00:08:46,800
All right then, Shishimaru!

527069
00:08:47,069 --> 00:08:48,569
You called?

529523
00:08:49,523 --> 00:08:50,789
Yan...

531717
00:08:51,717 --> 00:08:53,893
Just shouting loudly won't do any good

533949
00:08:53,949 --> 00:08:56,853
Shishimaru is simple-minded, so he should be easy to use it on!

536903
00:08:56,903 --> 00:08:58,666
All right, Shishimaru, let's try again!

538716
00:08:58,716 --> 00:09:00,337
I'm ready whenever you are!

540688
00:09:00,688 --> 00:09:01,818
Yan...

544469
00:09:04,469 --> 00:09:05,990
Kenichi

546135
00:09:06,135 --> 00:09:07,493
Shishimaru is smarter than you

547543
00:09:07,543 --> 00:09:09,517
There's no point in you learning anymore

550188
00:09:10,188 --> 00:09:11,033
Yay, I guess

551083
00:09:11,083 --> 00:09:12,488
I'm home

552539
00:09:12,539 --> 00:09:13,952
You're back?

555223
00:09:15,223 --> 00:09:16,403
Yan...

557916
00:09:17,916 --> 00:09:19,188
Oh, good boy

559229
00:09:19,229 --> 00:09:20,549
Could you not be so loud?

560590
00:09:20,590 --> 00:09:22,089
Oh, that's weird

562196
00:09:22,196 --> 00:09:23,763
Why does my Ninja Art: Body Freeze Technique

563803
00:09:23,803 --> 00:09:25,316
never work no matter how much I practice?

565356
00:09:25,356 --> 00:09:28,150
Your training isn't enough yet, you need to put your heart into it

569358
00:09:29,358 --> 00:09:31,571
Alright, the most important thing is to focus

571612
00:09:31,612 --> 00:09:34,046
You must never let the flame move

574087
00:09:34,087 --> 00:09:34,987
Mm

575608
00:09:35,608 --> 00:09:36,703
No good, it's not working

577762
00:09:37,762 --> 00:09:39,172
I told you it wouldn't work

579961
00:09:39,961 --> 00:09:41,437
Still not working

583668
00:09:43,668 --> 00:09:45,160
You can't do it

587025
00:09:47,025 --> 00:09:48,575
Yan...

589538
00:09:49,538 --> 00:09:50,915
Yan...

592823
00:09:52,823 --> 00:09:54,631
Oh! It worked!

594672
00:09:54,672 --> 00:09:56,106
Oh, the leaves have stopped!

596147
00:09:56,147 --> 00:09:58,179
Yay... It worked!

598220
00:09:58,220 --> 00:10:00,311
-Yay...
-You woke me up!

600352
00:10:00,352 --> 00:10:01,604
It worked!

602601
00:10:02,601 --> 00:10:03,444
Yan...

606081
00:10:06,081 --> 00:10:07,318
Oh, awesome!

607358
00:10:07,358 --> 00:10:10,400
It worked, it worked! Awesome!

610441
00:10:10,441 --> 00:10:12,520
Yay...

614358
00:10:14,358 --> 00:10:16,699
Why did you pretend to get hit by the Body Freeze Technique?

616750
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:18,745
Because Kenichi is so eager to learn

618796
00:10:18,796 --> 00:10:20,351
So I wanted to give him a sense of accomplishment

620391
00:10:20,391 --> 00:10:21,250
So he wouldn't feel discouraged

621301
00:10:21,301 --> 00:10:22,398
Yeah, exactly

622439
00:10:22,439 --> 00:10:23,733
If that's the case

623784
00:10:23,784 --> 00:10:26,920
If he really thinks he succeeded, it might cause trouble

630019
00:10:30,019 --> 00:10:30,958
Yan...

634304
00:10:34,304 --> 00:10:35,977
It worked!

638252
00:10:38,252 --> 00:10:39,337
Look at this fool

639378
00:10:39,378 --> 00:10:41,845
Thinking the cars stopped because of his Body Freeze Technique

641886
00:10:41,886 --> 00:10:42,806
So stupid!

642863
00:10:42,863 --> 00:10:44,913
Let's definitely mess with him

648983
00:10:48,983 --> 00:10:51,830
You two always bully me, just you watch!

651871
00:10:51,871 --> 00:10:53,197
Yan...

655164
00:10:55,164 --> 00:10:58,297
You're under my spell, now stay right there!

662609
00:11:02,609 --> 00:11:04,065
You rotten cat!

665752
00:11:05,752 --> 00:11:07,519
Ow, that hurts so much...

673042
00:11:13,042 --> 00:11:14,836
Ah, it's Yumeko!

676943
00:11:16,943 --> 00:11:18,713
Alright, let me try again

678763
00:11:18,763 --> 00:11:21,339
If it works this time, I'm going to give her a kiss!

681389
00:11:21,389 --> 00:11:22,166
Good morning

682216
00:11:22,216 --> 00:11:23,055
Yan...

685636
00:11:25,636 --> 00:11:28,531
What are you doing? Shouting out of nowhere, you scared me to death!

688581
00:11:28,581 --> 00:11:29,764
How unrefined!

690850
00:11:30,850 --> 00:11:32,460
Ow, that hurts!

692510
00:11:32,510 --> 00:11:34,404
Yumeko, wait for me!

694992
00:11:34,992 --> 00:11:38,004
Kenichi hasn't realised his Body Freeze Technique isn't up to scratch yet

702674
00:11:42,674 --> 00:11:43,647
That's really strange

703697
00:11:43,697 --> 00:11:46,240
It clearly worked on Kemumaki earlier

708375
00:11:48,375 --> 00:11:51,257
Kenichi Mitsuba, no daydreaming in class!

711665
00:11:51,665 --> 00:11:54,560
That's it, let me test it out on the teacher!

717183
00:11:57,183 --> 00:11:58,444
Yan...

720946
00:12:00,946 --> 00:12:02,209
How outrageous!

724024
00:12:04,024 --> 00:12:05,678
Shouting out loud during class!

725890
00:12:05,890 --> 00:12:07,372
I'm punishing you to stand!

728436
00:12:08,436 --> 00:12:10,349
Hey, what are you doing, Kenichi?

731433
00:12:11,433 --> 00:12:13,237
Hey... are you okay?

734970
00:12:14,970 --> 00:12:18,026
Oh no, Kenichi got caught in the teacher's Body Freeze Technique instead!

738076
00:12:18,076 --> 00:12:20,092
He really is simple-minded

740143
00:12:20,143 --> 00:12:22,863
He'll definitely never master it

746023
00:12:26,023 --> 00:12:29,043
"Studying Takes Self-Discipline"

759736
00:12:39,736 --> 00:12:41,880
-All right, they're all fried
-Yes!

764183
00:12:44,183 --> 00:12:46,416
It's done in no time using ninjutsu

769936
00:12:49,936 --> 00:12:51,622
I'm home! Whoa...

772250
00:12:52,250 --> 00:12:53,819
Oh, you're back?

773869
00:12:53,869 --> 00:12:54,820
Good boy, you're such a glutton

774860
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:56,440
Sneaking food as soon as you get home?

776916
00:12:56,916 --> 00:12:58,258
You definitely have homework today

778299
00:12:58,299 --> 00:13:00,538
All right, finish it before dinner, okay?

781971
00:13:01,971 --> 00:13:03,148
I know

783422
00:13:03,422 --> 00:13:06,357
That's right, the earlier you do your homework, the better

786407
00:13:06,407 --> 00:13:07,610
I know!

787660
00:13:07,660 --> 00:13:09,996
Why do you sound just like my mom?

790037
00:13:10,037 --> 00:13:13,238
No, I'm not lecturing you, I'm just speaking from the heart

793987
00:13:13,987 --> 00:13:16,920
Right, today there's only one assignment, an essay

797610
00:13:17,610 --> 00:13:20,004
Mm, I won't bother you while you do your homework

800044
00:13:20,044 --> 00:13:21,452
I'll head downstairs first

804364
00:13:24,364 --> 00:13:25,960
That's so hilarious!

808244
00:13:28,244 --> 00:13:29,328
You haven't finished your homework

809379
00:13:29,379 --> 00:13:31,479
You can't have this for now, I'm keeping it safe

811520
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:32,642
Give it back to me!

812696
00:13:32,696 --> 00:13:34,215
-Yan...
-Hey hey... how mean!

815352
00:13:35,352 --> 00:13:36,893
-Yan...
-Are you giving it back or not?

816958
00:13:36,958 --> 00:13:39,440
-Yan...
-Ow, hey...

820915
00:13:40,915 --> 00:13:42,823
Kenichi, just give up

822880
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:44,167
Finish your essay first

824217
00:13:44,217 --> 00:13:45,534
I know!

825584
00:13:45,584 --> 00:13:47,974
So annoying, it's barely any homework anyway

828024
00:13:48,024 --> 00:13:50,284
If I put my mind to it, I'll be done in no time

830464
00:13:50,464 --> 00:13:52,052
Kenichi, dinner's ready!

832093
00:13:52,093 --> 00:13:53,021
Coming!

833245
00:13:53,245 --> 00:13:54,261
I'll eat dinner first

834302
00:13:54,302 --> 00:13:55,420
Yan... ow...

835525
00:13:55,525 --> 00:13:57,465
Ow, how did that happen?

839892
00:13:59,892 --> 00:14:01,262
I'm full

843336
00:14:03,336 --> 00:14:04,546
Oh no!

844596
00:14:04,596 --> 00:14:06,362
Did I really take that long to eat?

848089
00:14:08,089 --> 00:14:09,491
Kenichi is being quite good

849542
00:14:09,542 --> 00:14:11,029
Wanting to finish his homework first

854148
00:14:14,148 --> 00:14:16,461
("ZETMAN")

856681
00:14:16,681 --> 00:14:18,840
Good thing I made it in time!

860890
00:14:20,890 --> 00:14:23,347
Awesome, this is so exciting...

863397
00:14:23,397 --> 00:14:25,109
Wow, awesome...

865425
00:14:25,425 --> 00:14:26,692
Off to bed!

869232
00:14:29,232 --> 00:14:31,450
Don't be so loud, you'll disturb Kenichi

871500
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,756
He's working hard on his homework right now, you know?

879129
00:14:39,129 --> 00:14:41,230
Kenichi, Kenichi!

886606
00:14:46,606 --> 00:14:49,063
It's already so late, and I haven't finished my homework yet

889114
00:14:49,114 --> 00:14:50,230
What am I going to do?

890280
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:53,012
I told you before to finish your homework before playing

893053
00:14:53,053 --> 00:14:54,184
Why didn't you listen?

894234
00:14:54,234 --> 00:14:56,430
Kenichi, it's almost 9:00

896471
00:14:56,471 --> 00:14:57,630
Why aren't you asleep yet this late?

897715
00:14:57,715 --> 00:14:58,737
Hurry and get into bed

898787
00:14:58,787 --> 00:15:00,841
- Yes!
- Going to sleep...

901211
00:15:01,211 --> 00:15:02,738
Hey, go to sleep

902831
00:15:02,831 --> 00:15:04,520
I... I haven't finished my homework yet...

904560
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,368
What? You haven't finished your homework?

906409
00:15:06,409 --> 00:15:07,628
Oh... yeah

907913
00:15:07,913 --> 00:15:09,763
Every day I tell you that as soon as you get home

909803
00:15:09,803 --> 00:15:11,341
the most important thing is to do your homework first

911382
00:15:11,382 --> 00:15:12,020
Mom

912060
00:15:12,060 --> 00:15:14,559
How about you wake me up early tomorrow morning to do it?

914600
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,283
No way, do it now

917870
00:15:17,870 --> 00:15:21,023
If you hadn't watched TV right when you got home, you'd be done, right?

921136
00:15:21,136 --> 00:15:23,879
This "My Father" essay is so hard to write...

923920
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:25,667
Ugh, what comes next?

925807
00:15:25,807 --> 00:15:27,461
"My father is a good father..."

927502
00:15:27,502 --> 00:15:29,137
Hey, no peeking!

929490
00:15:29,490 --> 00:15:31,945
I'm really sorry, I didn't mean to peek

931995
00:15:31,995 --> 00:15:34,109
I just wanted to help you

935074
00:15:35,074 --> 00:15:36,395
"During holidays, my father often"

936435
00:15:36,435 --> 00:15:38,054
"takes me fishing at the reservoir..."

938095
00:15:38,095 --> 00:15:39,800
"My Father"

939896
00:15:39,896 --> 00:15:41,540
Oh, that's it!

941580
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:42,399
That's it!

942440
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,660
I can tell you about my father

943700
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:45,880
so you can write your essay!

946440
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:47,766
"My Father"

947817
00:15:47,817 --> 00:15:50,190
"was originally a doorman serving in the Imperial Palace"

950240
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:52,038
"In fact, his identity was a cover"

952088
00:15:52,088 --> 00:15:54,323
"His true identity is an Iga ninja"

954373
00:15:54,373 --> 00:15:55,950
"His code name is Dragon in the Water"

956001
00:15:56,001 --> 00:15:57,598
"He is especially skilled at diving"

957647
00:15:57,647 --> 00:15:59,036
"and can stay underwater for a long time"

959077
00:15:59,077 --> 00:16:00,281
"without being noticed..."

961107
00:16:01,107 --> 00:16:02,336
Oh, Kenichi!

962386
00:16:02,386 --> 00:16:03,690
You can't fall asleep!

963740
00:16:03,740 --> 00:16:05,393
You still have to write your essay!

965434
00:16:05,434 --> 00:16:07,850
Kenichi! Kenichi!

967949
00:16:07,949 --> 00:16:09,293
Why aren't you asleep yet?

969343
00:16:09,343 --> 00:16:10,927
Kenichi, Mom is coming!

970968
00:16:10,968 --> 00:16:12,540
Quick, get up!

972724
00:16:12,724 --> 00:16:13,658
Kenichi

973698
00:16:13,698 --> 00:16:15,786
Oh my, why are you so hardworking today?

975991
00:16:15,991 --> 00:16:17,556
I'm almost done writing

978339
00:16:18,339 --> 00:16:20,105
Really? Are you cold?

980192
00:16:20,192 --> 00:16:21,425
Not cold...

981475
00:16:21,475 --> 00:16:23,640
Mom, you go out first, I'm not cold

983928
00:16:23,928 --> 00:16:25,692
All right, hurry up with your essay

985749
00:16:25,749 --> 00:16:26,920
Go to sleep soon!

988194
00:16:28,194 --> 00:16:29,745
It's the Ninja Art: Voice Mimicry Technique!

989795
00:16:29,795 --> 00:16:31,680
Great, it worked!

997042
00:16:37,042 --> 00:16:38,463
He's really so lazy

1000236
00:16:40,236 --> 00:16:42,976
Kenichi, you're going to be late!

1012196
00:16:52,196 --> 00:16:54,179
All right, are the essays done?

1014230
00:16:54,230 --> 00:16:56,007
- Yes...
- All done...

1016048
00:16:56,048 --> 00:16:59,106
All right, Kenichi Mitsuba, read your essay out loud for everyone

1019466
00:16:59,466 --> 00:17:01,509
Oh no... why did he have to pick me?

1021560
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:02,669
What's wrong? Can't do it?

1022720
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:03,823
Yes...

1025775
00:17:05,775 --> 00:17:08,497
"My father's name is Kentaro Mitsuba"

1028773
00:17:08,773 --> 00:17:10,733
"He takes the subway to the Imperial Palace every day"

1030783
00:17:10,783 --> 00:17:12,928
"Because he is a gatekeeper at the Imperial Palace"

1033208
00:17:13,208 --> 00:17:14,617
"In truth, that identity is just a cover"

1034667
00:17:14,667 --> 00:17:16,240
"His true identity is..."

1039196
00:17:19,196 --> 00:17:19,940
"On his days off"

1039980
00:17:19,980 --> 00:17:21,713
"Dad often takes me fishing at the reservoir"

1041763
00:17:21,763 --> 00:17:23,273
"Actually, the fishing is just a cover too"

1043323
00:17:23,323 --> 00:17:24,919
"He is an Iga ninja"

1044963
00:17:24,963 --> 00:17:26,520
"Known as the Dragon in the Water"

1046570
00:17:26,570 --> 00:17:27,900
"He especially loves diving underwater"

1047950
00:17:27,950 --> 00:17:29,813
"He can stay underwater for a very long time"

1049864
00:17:29,864 --> 00:17:32,766
"without anyone noticing, a true martial arts master..."

1056790
00:17:36,790 --> 00:17:38,577
This is completely absurd!

1059680
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,415
So that's what happened

1062055
00:17:42,055 --> 00:17:44,981
Oh, so you totally deserved getting scolded by the teacher

1065032
00:17:45,032 --> 00:17:47,539
Good boy, remember to do your homework from now on, okay?

1067586
00:17:47,586 --> 00:17:48,845
Yes, I will

1070102
00:17:50,102 --> 00:17:51,321
Ugh, what a pathetic sight

1071362
00:17:51,362 --> 00:17:52,660
As a real man

1072700
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:54,576
why are you crying so easily?

1079090
00:17:59,090 --> 00:18:01,761
Why are all of you crying along with Kenichi?

1081811
00:18:01,811 --> 00:18:03,601
Oh dear, now even I'm crying

1083651
00:18:03,651 --> 00:18:05,920
Mom, that's because you're cutting onions

1089036
00:18:09,036 --> 00:18:11,895
No wonder! It was the onions bringing tears to our eyes

1095390
00:18:15,390 --> 00:18:16,927
All right, no more slacking off

1096978
00:18:16,978 --> 00:18:19,270
Hurry up and finish your homework before playing, okay?

1099320
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:21,160
Oh man, so strict!
